                "retweet_count": 9,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Speaker Emerita Nancy Pelosi has been a steadfast champion for the American people. From the #AffordableCareAct, to the #AmericanRescuePlan, to the #InflationReductionAct, she helped deliver life-changing progress that expanded access to health care, uplifted working families, and strengthened communities across our nation.\n\nOver her 20 years leading @HouseDemocrats, she navigated some of the most difficult moments in our history. Through every trial, she led with unmatched strength, dignity, and grace. I am proud to call her both a colleague and a dear friend. Her legacy will continue to shape our country for generations to come.\nWishing you a wonderful and well-earned retirement, @SpeakerPelosi, you deserve it.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
