                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I\u2019m deeply disappointed that the Senate abandoned the fight for affordable health care for working families. Health care isn\u2019t a privilege \u2014 it\u2019s a right. We must keep fighting until every American can see a doctor without fear of financial ruin. #HealthCareForAll",
