                "reply_count": 0,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I am deeply disappointed in the Senate for abandoning the fight for affordable health care for working families. The refusal to extend ACA tax credits will force millions to pay more for the care they need. Health care is not a luxury \u2014 it\u2019s a lifeline. I stand with Leader Hakeem Jeffries and House Democrats in continuing the fight for every family\u2019s right to affordable, quality health care.",
