                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Did you know that 80 percent of voters, including 82 percent of swing voters, believe the Trump administration should prioritize domestic issues over the Argentina bailout? The American people are focused on the issues that affect their everyday lives like affordable health care and groceries. It\u2019s past time for this administration to listen to the people and put their needs first. #TuesdayTidbit",
