                "text": "Tonight, I voted NO on the disastrous Republican budget because it abandons the very people we were sent here to serve\u2014working families, seniors, and children who depend on affordable health care. \n\nRead my full statement: https://t.co/wBSmxg2oDe https://t.co/AVCgV04OFU",
