                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "On #RuralHealthDay, we recognize the vital role rural providers play in keeping our communities healthy. Everyone deserves access to quality health care\u2014no matter where they live. That\u2019s why I will always stand against cuts to #Medicaid that would devastate rural hospitals in states like #Louisiana. I\u2019ll continue fighting to protect coverage, strengthen our health care workforce, and ensure every family can get the care they deserve.",
