                "text": "Did you know that in less than two weeks, #ACA tax credits will expire, making health care unaffordable for countless working Americans? @HouseDemocrats have introduced a discharge petition to force a vote on a three-year extension of these lifesaving tax credits. It\u2019s past time for Republicans to join us and do what\u2019s right for the American people. #TuesdayTidbit",
