                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "To commemorate #WorldAidsDay, I\u2019m proud to display an homage to the Aids Memorial Quilt outside my office in honor of those we\u2019ve lost to HIV/AIDS. HIV services are a critical aspect of our public health infrastructure, and I\u2019m committed to protecting and preserving this lifesaving access to care.",
