                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Congratulations to my dear friend Charlotte Parent on her retirement from University Medical Center! For 36 years, Charlotte has served with extraordinary dedication as a nurse and healthcare leader. Her career has always been guided by one mission: caring for others.\nFrom directing Maternal and Child Services at Touro, to leading the New Orleans Health Department during the rebuilding of New Orleans East Hospital, to launching the Seeds of NOLA Trauma Recovery Center, Charlotte has consistently served our community with compassion, dignity, and unwavering commitment. I wish her all the best in retirement; she\u2019s earned it! @LCMCHealth",
