                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Reliable internet access is essential for every American for education, health care, jobs, & vital public services. Bridging the digital divide is critical to ensuring every community can fully participate in today\u2019s economy and our democracy.\n\nThat\u2019s why I\u2019m proud to re-launch the Wi-Fi Caucus alongside @SenJackyRosen, @SenatorRicketts, and @boblatta. Together, we\u2019re taking an important bipartisan step toward policies that promote digital equality and expand internet access for all our constituents.\nhttps://t.co/F222flxWOh",
